title: arf2-6_+IAA_1
source_name_ch1: Light grown liquid cultured seedlings (7-day old)
description: Surface-sterile seeds were germinated in liquid Murashige and Skoog medium containing 1.5% sucrose and cultured in a 16 h light/ 8 h dark cycle with gentle shaking. After 7 days culture period, seedlings were treated with 5µM IAA (IAA treated) or EtOH (control) for 2 h at 24 °C.; ; Line: arf2-6 (ecotype Columbia); Treatment: IAA treated; Replicate 1;

